  "rendered_html": "<div class=\"demo-author-page\"><div class=\"demo-author-breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/autorinnen-und-autoren\">&larr; Alle Autor:innen</a></div><section class=\"demo-author-head\"><div class=\"demo-author-photo\"><img src=\"images/johanna-grillmayer.jpg\" alt=\"Johanna Grillmayer\" width=\"300\"></div><div><h1>Johanna Grillmayer</h1><div class=\"demo-author-category\">Fiction/Die Weiße Reihe</div><div class=\"demo-author-bio\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">geboren 1974, lebt mit ihrer Familie in Wien. Studium der Geschichte an der Universität Wien. Arbeitet als Redakteurin beim ORF. Bei Müry Salzmann liegen zwei Bände ihrer Dystopia-Trilogie vor: <em>That’s life in Dystopia </em>und <em>Ein sicherer Ort</em>. Der dritte Teil ist in Arbeit. </p></div></div></section><h2 class=\"demo-author-section-title\">Bücher</h2><div class=\"demo-books\"><a class=\"demo-book\" href=\"/belletristik/ein-guter-mann\"><div class=\"demo-book-cover\"><img src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5e64d70aea31d869d6cfcb2e/62cfef0379fe7804bd0f3b0b/6864f42e40a81121db50b77a/1768656910216/ein-guter-mann-mockup.png?format=1500w\" alt=\"Ein guter Mann\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"demo-book-title\">Ein guter Mann</div><div class=\"demo-book-price\">28.00 EUR</div></a><a class=\"demo-book\" href=\"/belletristik/ein-sicherer-ort\"><div class=\"demo-book-cover\"><img src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5e64d70aea31d869d6cfcb2e/62ce94a7c3b19d4080c4c628/6696808801b30a20bf97f64f/1758813043699/Ein+Sicherer+Ort+MockUp.png?format=1500w\" alt=\"Ein sicherer Ort\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"demo-book-title\">Ein sicherer Ort</div><div class=\"demo-book-price\">28.00 EUR</div></a><a class=\"demo-book\" href=\"/belletristik/thats-life-in-dystopia\"><div class=\"demo-book-cover\"><img src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5e64d70aea31d869d6cfcb2e/62ce94a7c3b19d4080c4c628/646b772d119d0164eb2c360e/1768657023118/Thats+Life+in+Dystopia+MockUp.png?